NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/llm.tagParamArgs kind=func
  digest=b3:2c6957a9bb29f5215697353611d37ae3d4cd8cc9b6e8744b853be5f9b2c7da54 file=neo/internal/llm/client.go range=1197:1239 lang=go exported=false byte_range=42408:43598
  sig=func tagParamArgs(body string) string
  doc=tagParamArgs parses the `<parameter=key>value` spans of one tag-grammar call\nbody into a JSON-object argument string. Values are trimmed raw strings; a\nvalue that is itself standalone JSON (object/array/number/bool/null) is kept\ntyped so numeric and structured arguments survive the round trip.
